      "Status": "Registered",
      "SummaryOfActivities": "The Abounding Life Foundation advances the Christian faith by providing biblical teaching, practical life skills instruction, and spiritual encouragement to the community. The ministry develops and shares educational resources including sermons, study materials, and digital content to support personal growth and spiritual understanding. It also produces multimedia educational tools, such as video teachings, online courses, and documentary style content, to make faith based learning accessible to the public. Through all its activities, the foundation seeks to equip individuals to live their faith with love and kindness.",
